.TH "TODOPRO SCRATCHPAD CREATE" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro scratchpad create Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-scratchpad\-create \- Create a new scratchpad within a project.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro scratchpad create
[OPTIONS] PROJECT_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new scratchpad within a project.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t,\fP \-\-title TEXT
Scratchpad title
.TP
\fB\-c,\fP \-\-content TEXT
Note body (HTML/plaintext)
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-content\-file TEXT
Read note body from a file
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output TEXT
Output format  [default: table]
